OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry
OL,6,Finitially in the east, but rain will
OL,7,Fspread across the region this evening.
OL,8,FThe rain will turn heavy and
OL,9,Fpersistent at times, giving a wet but
OL,10,Fmild night. Breezy, especially along
OL,11,Fthe south coast.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTuesday:FRain will clear east during
OL,14,Fthe morning, with brighter skies
OL,15,Fdeveloping by lunchtime. A few showers
OL,16,Fpossible during the afternoon, but
OL,17,Fmany areas will be dry and bright.
OL,18,FFeeling cooler.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
